---
// Closing statement, a pinned scene: the camera rises to look straight down on the whole board;
// the heading and two sentences sit centred on a panel over it.
---

<section id="closing" class="scene" data-scene="closing" data-pin="150" data-chapter-name="Why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal glass max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center px-6 py-12 sm:px-14 sm:py-16">
      <p class="label label-mark">Why a person, not just a prompt</p>
      <h2 class="mt-8 text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl" data-split>Experience decides what to <em>build.</em></h2>
      <p class="mt-10 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-[52ch] mx-auto text-muted">
        AI writes code fast, and I use it every day. It does not know your business, what breaks in production at night, or which shortcut costs you a year later.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-[52ch] mx-auto text-muted">
        Someone who has shipped it before builds it in a fraction of the time, with fewer surprises, and leaves you a system you can still run in five years.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
